In Unity (Y-Up, meters), `5.4f` m/s corresponds to `540.0f` cm/s in Unreal Engine 5.7 (Z-Up, centimeters):
```cpp
void UMovementBridge_006::ApplyPlanarInput(float InputRight, float InputForward)
{
    GetCharacterMovement()->MaxWalkSpeed = 540.0f;
    const FVector MoveDir = (GetActorForwardVector() * InputForward + GetActorRightVector() * InputRight).GetSafeNormal();
    AddMovementInput(MoveDir, 1.0f);
